'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\10 - Audit Log Maintenance
' Version    : 4.4.0  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents 4.4.0)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAgents (BR_RunAuditMaint).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: open the agent, click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this
'              WHOLE file, Ctrl+S. Designer puts each part in its place automatically.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAgents > BR_RunAuditMaint):
'
' Keeps the audit trail from growing without limit:
'   A. log database: Entry documents older than LogEntryRetentionDays (30) and Audit/Run documents older than
'      LogAuditRetentionDays (365) are EXPORTED to CSV in AuditArchiveDir, the export is verified, then the
'      documents are deleted (needs Editor + Delete documents = the database owner)
'   B. AuditDir run folders older than AuditFolderRetentionDays (90): only *_debug.log files are deleted
' DryRun=1 (default) only counts. LIVE: type PURGE to confirm. Agree the retention periods with the
' audit/compliance owner first; copy the archive folder to your approved retention store.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAgents"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunAuditMaint()
End Sub
